  CORE: One bounded exemption (KS-1450): the Schemathesis baseline's <code>$generated.from_runs</code> run ids record which sweep produced a row and cannot carry an inline marker, so a lone string element of that exact shape is exempt in that one file — and a guard cell asserts every exempted line really is a <code>from_runs</code> member, so the exemption cannot widen silently.
